        "TileImage": "$($repository f412903b-4f2d-4680-8b66-d1e7f004a314).Image",
        "Description": "During Kronstadt Industries&apos; test trial of their prototype &quot;PALLAS&quot; in Africa two months ago, things did not go as planned as they had to bury 13 civillian casualties that day.\r\rConveniently, all official records state that the surviving witnesses have since gone &quot;missing&quot;\r\rThe three major culprits behind these events are:\r\rTyler Geier - Lead Weapons Manufacturer\rMikkel Bekenbauer - Lead AI Software Engineer\rJulien Heijmans - Project Manager\r\rLet&apos;s make sure this never happens again, 47.",
